===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Power Keepers|Wobbuffet|24}} from the {{TCG|EX Power Keepers}} expansion.
*'''Reply Strongly''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Sudowoodo|110}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

